    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Efuraimu nakora obusha, omushana nabinga omuyaga gw'oburugaizoba. Abaefuraimu bagambire ebishuba bakora n'obukatili bashagulirana. Nibakora emikataba hamoi na Asiria, kandi nibaguza Misiri amajuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama aina omushango ahali Yuda. Alibonabonyia Yakobo aha rw'eby'alikukora, amuhe ekibonabonyio kumutura ebigirobye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Yakobo yabaire ali omu nda ya nyina akakwata omurumuna ekisinziro, kandi kayabaire yabaire mushaija yafukana na Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akafukana n'omumalaika yamusinga, yashuba yataka yamushaba omugisha. Kayabaire ali Betheli yabonangana na Ruhanga, Ruhanga yamugambira ekigambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga w'amahe, ‘Mukama,’ nilyo ibaralye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho mbwenu inywe baijukuru ba Yakobo, mwesige Ruhanga wanyu mumugarukire. Mube besigwa mugire amazima, mushube mulinde n'eshubi mwije mubone Ruhanga eky'alibakolera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagamba ati, “Omutunzi akwete eminzani elikupima ebitagobire, nagonza okushasa banu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efuraimu agambire ati, ‘Ndi mutungi, eitunga ndiboine;’ kyonkai eitungalye lyona tilyakwiza ntambara ez'akozire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga wanyu aba inye ayabaihire Misiri. Ndishuba mbatuze omu mahema nk'okwo mugaikaramu omu biro bikuru ebiragiirwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nkagambira abarangi, n'inye naikaire nimbabonekera, mara omu kanwa k'abarangi n'inye nachwaga emigani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai leba, omuli Gileadi bakyafukamira ebihuuku, mara nikwo barafa. Orwo balikutamba ente ebitambo omuli Gileadi, na alutare zabo zilishusha entuumiro z'amabare omu ndimiro.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo akaba ahungiire Aramu; kugya kubona omukazi akagira owo yakolera, yamulisiza entama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akataho omurangi w'okwihya Abaisiraeli Misiri, omurangi ogwo yaba niwe abakiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaefuraimu banigaize muno Omukama; kityo alibabonabonyia aha rw'entambara z'obwitabantu, abature okumugora okwo bamugoire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
